                                                "sense_id": "1744c460-ec69-3607-90bc-f2a5b1ae2aca",
                                                "text": "1994, Carla Emery, The Encyclopedia of Country Living, Ninth Edition, Sasquatch Books, →ISBN, page 715,\nIf you do have extra milk, then by all means raise your extra bucklings and cull doelings for meat."
                                            },
